@title Project settings centre: standard, rules, languages, options and generate as tiles
@area Layout
# Lane V4g (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 6). File > Project settings... opens one
# window with what the File > Project submenu and Report languages held; File no longer
# has the Project submenu. Variant, option and tie take a name in the command field.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text File #1
wait 6
shot file-menu-one-project-row
expect "Project settings..."
click_text "Project settings..."
wait 10
shot centre-open
expect "Drawing and reports"
expect "Options and variants"
expect "Choose a setting"
check_layout
click_text "Rules"
wait 6
shot centre-picked-rules
expect "The rules for wire numbers"
check_layout
click_text "Open"
wait 10
shot rules-window
expect "Rules"
key Escape
wait 6
